      "title": "Will big software companies (like Adobe) come together to curb AI?",
      "summary": "Recently heard about the fact that someone vibe-coded Adobe Cloud apps and having read people's reactions, one thing is clear: people say that this is \"karma\" hitting Adobe back. Now if these developments really threaten the monopoly of some of the largest software companies in the world, it makes me wonder whether their business losses would stimulate them to come together and do something about this out-of-control tool we all call AI. What are your thoughts?",
